    <summary>Play keyboard sounds while typing in Windows desktop apps.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
Klakk adds keyboard sound effects while you type in Windows desktop applications. Choose from 14 included sound packs, adjust the volume and select your audio output. It plays added audio; it does not reduce your keyboard's physical noise or change the feel of its keys.

### Trial and purchase

This is proprietary trial software, maintained here by its developer. The full-featured trial lasts 3 days from first launch. Continued use requires purchasing and activating a Windows license: US$4.49 once, plus applicable taxes at checkout. Mac and Mac App Store licenses are separate purchases. Installing this package does not purchase or activate a license.

### Requirements and installation

Windows 10 or 11 on Intel/AMD x64 or ARM64. 32-bit Windows is unsupported. The official universal installer selects the native app architecture and includes its runtime. Installation is for the Windows account running Chocolatey, under that account's Local AppData; it is not a machine-wide installation. Run installation and removal as the same Windows account.

The current Klakk 1.4.1 installer is unsigned. This package downloads it from the official Klakk download host and checks its pinned SHA-256 before unattended installation. Silent installation does not launch Klakk. Open it yourself, enable playback in General, and choose a sound pack, volume and Output Device in Audio.

Typing text and raw key codes are not uploaded. The direct edition sends usage and trial/licensing communications; see the [Windows privacy policy](https://tryklakk.com/en/windows/privacy/).

[Preview the sounds in your browser](https://tryklakk.com/en/keyboard-sounds/?utm_source=chocolatey&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=windows_distribution) or follow the [Windows setup and no-sound guide](https://tryklakk.com/en/blog/windows-keyboard-sounds-arm64-x64-setup/?utm_source=chocolatey&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=windows_distribution).
    ]]></description>
